  "country": "PT",
  "language": "pt-PT",
  "purpose": "Canonical guide for m3uCrawler normalization of Portuguese TV/radio playlists.",
  "principles": [
    "Canonical channel identity is independent of operator position.",
    "Positions are normalized for a Portuguese IPTV experience, not copied from one operator.",
    "RTP1, RTP2, SIC and TVI are fixed at positions 1-4.",
    "Groups are canonical and must be configurable from the Dashboard.",
    "VOD is separate from linear TV and may be enabled/disabled from the Dashboard.",
    "Source playlists may contain aliases, duplicates, operator-specific numbering and inconsistent group names."
  ],
